{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b7c6a0c521690cdeb4063a44b8044e9693b53eb5d9bc9e7863ecd7f167bf83f0","ja":"で、今、説明したコードを\n実際に弾いてみると……。","zh":"然后，把刚才说明的和弦\n实际弹奏一下的话……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9a6ce449a88f8050791cd73d05bfd8b629caf88e144a4f73a3a5d141d2678df3","ja":"わぁ～♪　きれいな音だね！\nみんなにも、聞かせてあげたいな～。","zh":"哇～♪　声音真好听呢！\n好想让大家也听听看啊～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bce7f8f0647efe0d53e8422b4ac44f20fd0569360900aa49d4d3cbfef31ee0d5","ja":"ん？　みんなって？","zh":"嗯？大家是指？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b6d2bf1fa7f7fb9b5d121097ed9c5a36fdd02dac20aeb9d51b07555dcbbeeb92","ja":"給食の時間にね、ジュリアさんにギターを\n教えてもらうこと、友達に話したの。","zh":"吃午餐的时候，我跟朋友说了\n茱莉亚教我弹吉他的事。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1114148bcc6773e03500cdd2052e271b78ba5b1a36b60cdfe34d39a52b62fe3c","ja":"そしたらみんな、「ギターってカッコいいよね」とか、\n「ひいてみたい」って、すごく盛り上がったんだよ。","zh":"然后大家都纷纷说着“吉他好帅啊”、\n“好想弹弹看”，聊得可起劲了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9a9a57d872844471b99dc57c87a1bf694515fb5de7288bdc951e01f6c1aa6143","ja":"へぇ、育の友達も興味を持ってくれてるのか。\n嬉しいよ♪","zh":"诶，育的朋友也感兴趣吗？\n真让人高兴♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9548412d4dca5f5403890261b39019d288e31d4167c0f6bc550f70c8431225e9","ja":"うん！　ジュリアさんに教わるのがうらやましいって、\nみんなに言われちゃった♪","zh":"嗯！大家都说很羡慕我\n能向茱莉亚请教呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ac61bf32f933418ef2d4cebc29b6c29596b2c1db334d5ce01ef8a93c9d55fcd0","ja":"そっか……なら、その子たちにも教えてやろうか？\nギターの魅力、あたしもたくさん伝えたいしさ。","zh":"这样啊……那，要不要我也教教那些孩子？\n而且我也想把吉他的魅力多传达给大家呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8239e831fb4c1967e1baa450e602c2d979037110b4cde733eea2a33d79226729","ja":"えっ、いいの？　ありがとう～！\nジュリア先生のギター教室、だね！","zh":"诶，可以吗？太感谢啦～！\n这就是茱莉亚老师的吉他教室了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1523.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9ac258c589adbd96a08c8239a4438a86ea2c704dd5abe7d408990049a6c7b8d9","ja":"はは、そんな本格的なものじゃないけどな。\nじゃあ、次の休みに♪","zh":"哈哈，倒也没那么专业啦。\n那就下次休息时见♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
